<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:21.400" end="00:00:26.100" style="s2">Guards, who let this beggar into my</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.400" end="00:00:26.100" style="s2">engagement?</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.680" end="00:00:38.700" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.500" end="00:00:58.900" style="s2">Not this gate, Ebehi.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.700" end="00:01:00.800" style="s2">Back gate.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.900" end="00:01:03.500" style="s2">Nobody wants to see a baker where the</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.800" end="00:01:05.800" style="s2">in-laws walk.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.500" end="00:01:07.400" style="s2">Ma, the loaves are still hot. The front</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.800" end="00:01:10.300" style="s2">is faster and the guests are already</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.400" end="00:01:10.300" style="s2">asking for bread.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.900" end="00:01:16.700" style="s2">Then the guests can wait for bread from</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.900" end="00:01:19.200" style="s2">the back.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.700" end="00:01:19.200" style="s2">Go round.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.300" end="00:01:27.100" style="s2">Adesuwa, they are close. The groom&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.000" end="00:01:27.100" style="s2">cars have left the junction.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.100" end="00:01:36.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, today is your engagement. Bless a</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.000" end="00:01:37.900" style="s2">hungry man with anything.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.500" end="00:01:39.800" style="s2">Even the bread you will throw away</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.900" end="00:01:42.100" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.800" end="00:01:43.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who let this thing sit at my gate on my</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.100" end="00:01:45.900" style="s2">engagement day?</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.900" end="00:01:49.100" style="s2">Look at his feet.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.900" end="00:01:49.100" style="s2">Look at the sand on him.</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.700" end="00:01:53.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only one loaf, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.400" end="00:01:56.200" style="s2">I will eat it far from here where your</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.500" end="00:01:57.800" style="s2">guests cannot see me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.200" end="00:02:01.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guards, beat this thing away from my</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.800" end="00:02:01.792" style="s2">gate before my in-laws arrive.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.292" end="00:02:13.892" style="s2">Smile for my page, Adesuwa. This one</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.192" end="00:02:13.892" style="s2">will go far.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.292" end="00:02:22.792" style="s2">What are you looking at, back gate girl?</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.192" end="00:02:22.792" style="s2">Go round.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.092" end="00:02:36.792" style="s2">Here,</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.092" end="00:02:39.092" style="s2">jollof rice from the staff pot and bread</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.792" end="00:02:41.092" style="s2">still warm.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.092" end="00:02:42.392" style="s2">It is my own plate, so nobody inside</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.092" end="00:02:43.692" style="s2">will miss it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.392" end="00:02:46.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your own dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.692" end="00:02:48.892" style="s2">Then what will you eat tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.292" end="00:02:50.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am a baker. I eat flour all day. Eat</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.892" end="00:02:53.192" style="s2">quickly before the guards come round</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.692" end="00:02:53.192" style="s2">this side.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.792" end="00:02:59.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The same moon is on your thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.792" end="00:03:01.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brass. I touched it hot when I was nine</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.392" end="00:03:03.692" style="s2">and cried the whole night.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.792" end="00:03:06.292" style="s2">He said now the bread will always know</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.692" end="00:03:06.292" style="s2">my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.592" end="00:03:10.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That woman at the gate,</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.392" end="00:03:13.392" style="s2">who is she to you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.992" end="00:03:15.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adesuwa is my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.392" end="00:03:17.192" style="s2">Her mother married my father when I was</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.392" end="00:03:20.792" style="s2">10.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.192" end="00:03:20.792" style="s2">My father is gone six years.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.892" end="00:03:24.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why feed a stranger on your</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.392" end="00:03:26.992" style="s2">sister&#39;s big night? They will punish you</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.392" end="00:03:26.992" style="s2">for this plate.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.392" end="00:03:32.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe they will.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.392" end="00:03:34.892" style="s2">My father used to say bread does not ask</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.592" end="00:03:37.892" style="s2">who you are.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.892" end="00:03:39.492" style="s2">Bread does not ask who you are.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.892" end="00:03:41.792" style="s2">They already talk of rent for the boys&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.492" end="00:03:45.292" style="s2">quarters behind my own father&#39;s house,</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.792" end="00:03:45.292" style="s2">or his oven goes on the street.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.292" end="00:03:51.192" style="s2">Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.692" end="00:03:53.837" style="s2">I got in dry to my straight and this</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.192" end="00:03:55.857" style="s2">watch routine.</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.837" end="00:03:55.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.492" end="00:04:00.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You give away your dinner and you still</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.292" end="00:04:01.994" style="s2">invite me for breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.392" end="00:04:04.494" style="s2">And the party behind this wall, who</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.994" end="00:04:04.494" style="s2">lucky man?</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.294" end="00:04:09.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister is marrying the Osayande son.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.194" end="00:04:10.994" style="s2">Nobody in this house has ever seen his</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.894" end="00:04:13.694" style="s2">face,</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.994" end="00:04:13.694" style="s2">not even her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.994" end="00:04:33.394" style="s2">The woman I am to marry ordered them to</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.894" end="00:04:33.394" style="s2">beat me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.594" end="00:04:38.378" style="s2">And the sister they sent through the</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.894" end="00:04:39.894" style="s2">back gate gave me her own dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.378" end="00:04:41.594" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.894" end="00:04:43.894" style="s2">I am going back in there tonight in</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.594" end="00:04:45.894" style="s2">these clothes to end it in front of all</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.894" end="00:04:47.794" style="s2">of them.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.894" end="00:04:49.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down Osaro Osayande, you walk into</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.794" end="00:04:51.094" style="s2">nothing tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.494" end="00:04:53.194" style="s2">Your driver went round that house this</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.094" end="00:04:55.494" style="s2">afternoon. The gold on that family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.194" end="00:04:59.194" style="s2">neck is rented.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.494" end="00:05:01.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because they want to look rich for us.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.194" end="00:05:03.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because a house that rents its gold is</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.494" end="00:05:06.294" style="s2">selling something.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.394" end="00:05:08.694" style="s2">Nobody in that house has seen your face.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.294" end="00:05:11.094" style="s2">Keep it so for 1 month.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.694" end="00:05:12.994" style="s2">Sit at that girl&#39;s kiosk with nothing</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.094" end="00:05:14.494" style="s2">and see if her bread is still free when</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.994" end="00:05:17.094" style="s2">you have nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.494" end="00:05:18.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And while I sit on a bench</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.094" end="00:05:20.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will see what that house is selling</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.994" end="00:05:22.494" style="s2">and to whom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.394" end="00:05:23.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And my engagement?</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.494" end="00:05:27.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Goes on.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.694" end="00:05:27.194" style="s2">Let the bride think she has won.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.494" end="00:05:34.294" style="s2">I will give her your ring myself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.294" end="00:05:50.094" style="s2">Good evening my people.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.094" end="00:05:51.294" style="s2">My grandson&#39;s flight from Rotterdam was</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.094" end="00:05:53.794" style="s2">delayed.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.294" end="00:05:56.294" style="s2">His family has come in his place and his</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.794" end="00:05:58.594" style="s2">family is enough.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.294" end="00:06:01.594" style="s2">Mama you are welcome, welcome. Our house</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.594" end="00:06:03.594" style="s2">is honored tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.594" end="00:06:06.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you Madam Gladys. Your house is</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.594" end="00:06:06.995" style="s2">very full of gold tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.395" end="00:06:15.495" style="s2">This ring has stayed in the Osayande</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.195" end="00:06:17.695" style="s2">house for three generations.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.495" end="00:06:20.495" style="s2">The engagement will be the last Saturday</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.695" end="00:06:21.995" style="s2">of this month, 2 o&#39;clock at the Ivory</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.495" end="00:06:25.395" style="s2">Hall.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.995" end="00:06:27.395" style="s2">Let everybody here hear it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.395" end="00:06:28.695" style="s2">My dear, did anyone come to your gate</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.395" end="00:06:31.795" style="s2">tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.695" end="00:06:31.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the wind, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.795" end="00:06:36.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the wind.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.095" end="00:06:39.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.795" end="00:06:43.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my day, my dear, the wind did not</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.395" end="00:06:43.395" style="s2">wear rags and ask for bread.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.139" end="00:06:49.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.895" end="00:06:49.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, in this street even the wind begs.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.895" end="00:07:01.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serve the groom&#39;s table</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.695" end="00:07:02.795" style="s2">on your knees as we do for in-laws.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.195" end="00:07:05.195" style="s2">Our girl from the back will feed you,</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.795" end="00:07:05.195" style="s2">mama.</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.995" end="00:07:10.695" style="s2">You baked this, child?</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.395" end="00:07:13.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.695" end="00:07:15.995" style="s2">This morning before the sun came up.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.795" end="00:07:17.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She bakes, mama. That is all she does.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.995" end="00:07:20.095" style="s2">Keep moving, the drinks are waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.795" end="00:07:20.095" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.495" end="00:07:32.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, it is real.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.295" end="00:07:32.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So is the lender. Smile for the cameras.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.595" end="00:07:38.695" style="s2">The gold goes back to the jeweler on</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.395" end="00:07:40.895" style="s2">Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.695" end="00:07:42.595" style="s2">That man counted them twice when he gave</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.895" end="00:07:44.795" style="s2">them to me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.595" end="00:07:47.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, we cannot keep renting. The hall</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.795" end="00:07:50.095" style="s2">alone, then the cars, the guards. The</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.695" end="00:07:51.795" style="s2">Osayandes will expect more at the Ivory</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.095" end="00:07:53.695" style="s2">Hall, not less.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.795" end="00:07:56.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then listen well</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.695" end="00:07:59.195" style="s2">because I will say it once.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.995" end="00:08:00.795" style="s2">We have borrowed and spent to look like</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.195" end="00:08:02.595" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.795" end="00:08:04.595" style="s2">The man who lends to us now does not</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.595" end="00:08:05.495" style="s2">want promises. He wants something with a</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.595" end="00:08:07.297" style="s2">roof.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.495" end="00:08:09.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have no roof.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.297" end="00:08:09.997" style="s2">This house.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.097" end="00:08:14.797" style="s2">This house is in Ebehi&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.697" end="00:08:18.897" style="s2">Her father&#39;s will.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.797" end="00:08:18.897" style="s2">I may live in it. Nothing more.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.197" end="00:08:25.997" style="s2">Her name and her thumb on that man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.797" end="00:08:27.797" style="s2">paper and he gives us 40 million naira.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.997" end="00:08:28.997" style="s2">The hall, the cars, the guards, the</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.797" end="00:08:31.597" style="s2">gold.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.997" end="00:08:33.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And when does he want it back?</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.597" end="00:08:36.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before noon on the Monday after the</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.597" end="00:08:36.397" style="s2">engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.297" end="00:08:43.597" style="s2">After Saturday the 31st your husband&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.197" end="00:08:45.097" style="s2">money pays him.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.597" end="00:08:47.797" style="s2">If it does not</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.097" end="00:08:50.397" style="s2">the lender takes the house.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.797" end="00:08:53.497" style="s2">Either way it is her house not ours. By</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.397" end="00:08:56.197" style="s2">then in the Osayande mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.497" end="00:08:58.497" style="s2">She will never give her thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.197" end="00:09:01.797" style="s2">Who said give?</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.497" end="00:09:01.797" style="s2">Then leave her thumb to me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.197" end="00:09:07.597" style="s2">Her ID card is in the bakery drawer.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.797" end="00:09:10.097" style="s2">Take her good scarf too.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.597" end="00:09:13.197" style="s2">Nobody looks at a poor girl&#39;s face.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.097" end="00:09:13.197" style="s2">They look at her scarf.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.097" end="00:09:28.097" style="s2">You came. It is still hot from the oven.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.297" end="00:09:29.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not free. A man who eats must carry</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.097" end="00:09:30.897" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.197" end="00:09:31.597" style="s2">Give me work first and then give me</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.897" end="00:09:33.297" style="s2">bread.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.597" end="00:09:36.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.297" end="00:09:39.597" style="s2">My business is one kiosk and one bench.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.797" end="00:09:39.597" style="s2">What will you carry?</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.397" end="00:09:46.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those trays.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.897" end="00:09:48.197" style="s2">The Okada men are shouting for bread</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.497" end="00:09:51.597" style="s2">across the road.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.197" end="00:09:51.597" style="s2">And you have only two hands.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.997" end="00:09:55.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then carry the trays, bread and two</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.197" end="00:09:58.397" style="s2">naira for the morning. That is all this</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.997" end="00:10:02.597" style="s2">kiosk can pay.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.397" end="00:10:02.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is 200 more than the gates paid me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.697" end="00:10:07.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never even asked your name.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.597" end="00:10:08.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Osaro.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.097" end="00:10:11.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Osaro?</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.697" end="00:10:11.897" style="s2">Like my sister&#39;s groom.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.098" end="00:10:16.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half of Benin is called Osaro.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.698" end="00:10:19.498" style="s2">Throw a stone at that filling station</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.298" end="00:10:19.498" style="s2">and you will hit three of us.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.798" end="00:10:27.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What thing be this?</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.198" end="00:10:30.998" style="s2">You don&#39;t start to employ beggar now?</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.898" end="00:10:33.198" style="s2">Is he paying you or are you paying him?</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.998" end="00:10:35.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Nosa, he is carrying trays for his</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.198" end="00:10:37.998" style="s2">bread. Be nice to him.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.598" end="00:10:41.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am nice. I will be nicer if he carries</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.998" end="00:10:41.098" style="s2">my plantain too o.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.798" end="00:10:50.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning sister. Good morning</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.898" end="00:10:54.198" style="s2">sister. One loaf please. The moon one.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.398" end="00:10:54.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They are all the moon one, my brother.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.198" end="00:11:00.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the bread I ate last night.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.298" end="00:11:14.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Papa, the moon sold out again today.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.998" end="00:11:16.098" style="s2">I wore your scarf to the junction, the</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.598" end="00:11:18.498" style="s2">last thing you gave me and it brought me</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.098" end="00:11:18.498" style="s2">luck.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.098" end="00:11:27.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You fed a beggar at my wall,</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.198" end="00:11:29.598" style="s2">on my daughter&#39;s night, with my in-laws</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.198" end="00:11:31.598" style="s2">on the road.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.598" end="00:11:33.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was my own plate ma. He was bleeding</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.598" end="00:11:35.498" style="s2">from the cane.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.798" end="00:11:37.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then from this Friday you pay for your</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.498" end="00:11:37.998" style="s2">plate.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.998" end="00:11:45.398" style="s2">50,000 naira every Friday for the boys</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.898" end="00:11:48.898" style="s2">quarters and this room.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.398" end="00:11:48.898" style="s2">Or the oven goes on the street.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.598" end="00:11:54.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, this was my father&#39;s bakery. He</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.798" end="00:11:56.398" style="s2">built that oven with his own hands.</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.498" end="00:11:59.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father is in the ground.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.398" end="00:11:59.898" style="s2">The ground does not pay the light bill.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.198" end="00:12:04.698" style="s2">And my engagement cake, five tiers white</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.798" end="00:12:08.598" style="s2">and gift to your sister.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.698" end="00:12:08.598" style="s2">Five tiers is two weeks of flour.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.298" end="00:12:12.998" style="s2">Then it will be a big gift.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.598" end="00:12:19.699" style="s2">Do not touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.599" end="00:12:19.699" style="s2">These nails cost more than your oven.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.299" end="00:12:28.299" style="s2">The hall security wants a list of</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.099" end="00:12:28.299" style="s2">everybody who will carry food inside.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.899" end="00:12:32.499" style="s2">I mean Lee,</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.999" end="00:12:35.399" style="s2">twin.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.999" end="00:12:48.899" style="s2">Papa, they won&#39;t rent for your oven.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.633" end="00:12:51.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.499" end="00:12:59.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your shoulder can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.699" end="00:13:00.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pius, tell him what you found.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.099" end="00:13:02.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, I went round the jewelers in the</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.699" end="00:13:06.199" style="s2">city. The gold that family wore last</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.799" end="00:13:06.199" style="s2">night was rented, every piece.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.099" end="00:13:13.199" style="s2">And Madam Gladys owes a money lender 40</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.199" end="00:13:15.399" style="s2">million naira after your engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.199" end="00:13:18.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I am her loan?</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.399" end="00:13:22.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, there is more.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.499" end="00:13:22.099" style="s2">Your beating is on the internet.</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.499" end="00:13:27.899" style="s2">400,000 people have watched you get</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.999" end="00:13:29.799" style="s2">canned. The caption says bride clears</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.899" end="00:13:31.799" style="s2">her gate.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.799" end="00:13:33.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 400,000 people and not one of them</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.799" end="00:13:34.099" style="s2">looked at my face.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.099" end="00:13:36.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.099" end="00:13:37.599" style="s2">Then your face still belongs to this</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.099" end="00:13:38.499" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.599" end="00:13:40.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.499" end="00:13:42.199" style="s2">when I go to that kiosk again, I will</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.399" end="00:13:44.599" style="s2">act like a stranger.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.199" end="00:13:44.599" style="s2">Watch me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.699" end="00:13:52.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son, sit down before you arrest</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.799" end="00:13:52.399" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.099" end="00:13:57.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does my father know any of this?</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.799" end="00:14:00.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father is in London with stitches</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.699" end="00:14:03.299" style="s2">in his chest. He left this match to me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.299" end="00:14:03.299" style="s2">Leave him to his heart.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.499" end="00:14:13.499" style="s2">One of these mornings, I will buy bread</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.299" end="00:14:13.499" style="s2">like any old woman.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.099" end="00:14:20.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A A does not carry the time.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.001" end="00:14:33.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hide the good loaves before she asks for</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.001" end="00:14:33.701" style="s2">discounts.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.701" end="00:14:40.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ebehi, I need bread that looks aesthetic</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.501" end="00:14:42.701" style="s2">for my page. The Osiande bride buys</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.501" end="00:14:45.901" style="s2">local. My followers</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.701" end="00:14:48.201" style="s2">Wait. Adesuwa, look at the tray boy. Is</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.901" end="00:14:51.201" style="s2">that not the one from your gate?</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.201" end="00:14:51.201" style="s2">The one from my video?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.601" end="00:14:59.301" style="s2">The gate rat works for you now?</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.401" end="00:15:01.601" style="s2">You fed him at my wall and now you pay</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.301" end="00:15:03.801" style="s2">him at your kiosk.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.601" end="00:15:05.901" style="s2">He carries trays for his bread. He works</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.801" end="00:15:09.201" style="s2">at Adesuwa. Buy what you came for and</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.901" end="00:15:09.201" style="s2">let my customers pass.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.301" end="00:15:22.201" style="s2">Two brown, pick them up, both of you. On</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.001" end="00:15:24.401" style="s2">your knees.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.201" end="00:15:26.501" style="s2">I will not kneel in a gutter for you. He</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.401" end="00:15:29.301" style="s2">works here and that bread was paid for</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.501" end="00:15:29.301" style="s2">with my night.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.801" end="00:15:36.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave it. Go and serve the queue. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.501" end="00:15:39.701" style="s2">already dusty.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.001" end="00:15:39.701" style="s2">I am already dusty. Let me do it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.901" end="00:15:45.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My people, the rat is kneeling for the</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.301" end="00:15:49.001" style="s2">sister.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.701" end="00:15:49.001" style="s2">This one will go far again.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.101" end="00:15:55.601" style="s2">Fine girl, you not go pay for the bread</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.801" end="00:15:59.901" style="s2">where you throw for gutter.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.601" end="00:15:59.901" style="s2">Put it on my engagement, back gate girl.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.801" end="00:16:07.201" style="s2">20 loaves, that was the whole night&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.501" end="00:16:10.801" style="s2">baking.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.201" end="00:16:10.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She did not even look at my face.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.401" end="00:16:23.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Ebehi, my late husband&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.702" end="00:16:25.702" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.302" end="00:16:28.102" style="s2">The house on Ihama Road is in her name,</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.702" end="00:16:30.802" style="s2">as the will says.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.102" end="00:16:33.902" style="s2">She is shy with big men, so forgive her</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.802" end="00:16:33.902" style="s2">if she does not talk.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.702" end="00:16:39.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shy is good.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.802" end="00:16:43.402" style="s2">Shy does not argue.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.802" end="00:16:45.102" style="s2">Let me see the face on this card.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.402" end="00:16:47.702" style="s2">Ebehi Godaro,</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.102" end="00:16:49.902" style="s2">listen well, my dear, because I say this</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.702" end="00:16:51.902" style="s2">one time.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.902" end="00:16:53.602" style="s2">40 million naira against the house on</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.902" end="00:16:56.202" style="s2">Ihama Road.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.602" end="00:16:58.602" style="s2">Before noon on the Monday after your</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.202" end="00:17:03.002" style="s2">sister&#39;s engagement, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.602" end="00:17:05.402" style="s2">every kobo comes back to this desk.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.002" end="00:17:07.102" style="s2">If not, I take the roof and the girl</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.402" end="00:17:09.702" style="s2">answers to the police.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.102" end="00:17:09.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.326" end="00:17:12.346" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.502" end="00:17:16.702" style="s2">She understands, sir. The money will</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.302" end="00:17:18.902" style="s2">come long before that day.</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.702" end="00:17:20.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Money always comes before that day until</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.902" end="00:17:23.402" style="s2">it does not. Sign here</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.902" end="00:17:23.402" style="s2">and here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.391" end="00:17:29.202" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.602" end="00:17:32.402" style="s2">Now your thumb, my dear. Press well. My</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.202" end="00:17:32.402" style="s2">paper must know you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.002" end="00:17:42.702" style="s2">That house is now mine. The transfer</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.702" end="00:17:42.702" style="s2">goes this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.902" end="00:17:50.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you see him, Mummy? One second on</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.602" end="00:17:53.202" style="s2">the card. One second. Every poor girl&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.002" end="00:17:55.102" style="s2">thumb looks the same. Not here. Not one</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.202" end="00:17:58.602" style="s2">word in this building.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.102" end="00:18:02.102" style="s2">Burn that scarf tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.602" end="00:18:02.102" style="s2">Burn silk, silk.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.202" end="00:18:07.802" style="s2">One loaf.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.502" end="00:18:12.102" style="s2">The one with the moon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.802" end="00:18:12.102" style="s2">Good morning, ma. That is 500 naira.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.202" end="00:18:18.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For bread that smells like this,</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.702" end="00:18:21.202" style="s2">you will die poor, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.702" end="00:18:21.803" style="s2">Charge me more.</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.202" end="00:18:23.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, the</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.803" end="00:18:26.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; price is the price. Everybody at this</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.603" end="00:18:28.903" style="s2">junction pays 500.</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.203" end="00:18:31.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I am not everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.903" end="00:18:33.603" style="s2">Take 1,000.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.403" end="00:18:34.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then take two loaves, ma. I do not sell</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.603" end="00:18:37.503" style="s2">air.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.903" end="00:18:39.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, young man, come here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.503" end="00:18:41.603" style="s2">You smell like a man who used to be</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.203" end="00:18:41.603" style="s2">rich.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.603" end="00:18:48.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, I smell of flour and the filling</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.403" end="00:18:48.903" style="s2">station.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.203" end="00:18:54.703" style="s2">Under that.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.703" end="00:18:57.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am old. My nose is the only part of me</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.703" end="00:18:57.903" style="s2">that still works properly.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.303" end="00:19:06.263" style="s2">Mama, that one, the only rich thing he</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.603" end="00:19:08.283" style="s2">gets na the bench where he dey sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.263" end="00:19:08.283" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.303" end="00:19:11.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.703" end="00:19:16.903" style="s2">My daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.203" end="00:19:19.603" style="s2">bread like this should not live in a box</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.903" end="00:19:19.603" style="s2">by the road.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.103" end="00:19:30.403" style="s2">I will give you 1 million naira.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.403" end="00:19:32.703" style="s2">Rent a proper shop with a proper oven.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.403" end="00:19:34.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, ma. Truly.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.703" end="00:19:37.003" style="s2">But if you pay for my shop, it will be</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.403" end="00:19:37.003" style="s2">your shop.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.358" end="00:19:40.378" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.403" end="00:19:44.403" style="s2">When I have a shop, it will carry my</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.403" end="00:19:47.803" style="s2">father&#39;s name.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.403" end="00:19:47.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if I wait for that day</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.003" end="00:19:55.103" style="s2">I make you know I just agree.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.803" end="00:20:07.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If anything happens to this child, call</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.303" end="00:20:10.603" style="s2">me. Do not tell her I gave it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.703" end="00:20:10.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.703" end="00:20:17.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An old woman who likes bread.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.303" end="00:20:17.603" style="s2">Her bread is still free.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.503" end="00:20:27.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came in by the back gate. If mummy</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.605" end="00:20:30.405" style="s2">sees you, she will call the police on</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.705" end="00:20:32.605" style="s2">both of us.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.405" end="00:20:34.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we bake quietly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.605" end="00:20:36.205" style="s2">Five tears for your sister and you have</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.605" end="00:20:39.005" style="s2">two hands.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.205" end="00:20:39.005" style="s2">Show me what to do.</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.705" end="00:20:44.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cream the butter and sugar slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.005" end="00:20:49.805" style="s2">You are beating it like it stole your</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.305" end="00:20:49.805" style="s2">slippers.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.105" end="00:20:55.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It did not steal them. I gave them away.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.105" end="00:20:59.005" style="s2">Why do you always come by that small</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.505" end="00:20:59.005" style="s2">gate? It is your father&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.405" end="00:21:03.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my father&#39;s house, I use the back</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.005" end="00:21:05.005" style="s2">gate.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.305" end="00:21:07.905" style="s2">Since he died, nobody has opened the</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.005" end="00:21:07.905" style="s2">front door for me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.805" end="00:21:14.505" style="s2">Tomorrow is Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.605" end="00:21:16.405" style="s2">50,000 naira.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.505" end="00:21:18.305" style="s2">Rent for my father&#39;s oven.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.405" end="00:21:19.705" style="s2">Every naira this kiosk made since</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.305" end="00:21:22.705" style="s2">Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.705" end="00:21:25.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what is left for you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.705" end="00:21:28.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The tin</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.005" end="00:21:28.405" style="s2">and the flour for her cake.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.205" end="00:21:37.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Straight.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.005" end="00:21:40.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Papa used to hold my hand like that when</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.705" end="00:21:40.405" style="s2">I was small.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.705" end="00:21:46.305" style="s2">Mummy, she has her beggar in our yard.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.205" end="00:21:48.105" style="s2">Let her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.305" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">A girl with a beggar is a girl nobody</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.105" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">believes.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.505" end="00:22:00.505" style="s2">She made it with her own two hands.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.405" end="00:22:00.505" style="s2">Taste it, Adisua.</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.605" end="00:22:07.755" style="s2">It tastes like a kiosk.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.735" end="00:22:07.755" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.355" end="00:22:12.305" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.705" end="00:22:15.005" style="s2">It is butter cake, Adisua.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.305" end="00:22:16.605" style="s2">Vanilla and coconut.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.005" end="00:22:18.905" style="s2">The way Papa made it for your mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.605" end="00:22:21.105" style="s2">birthday every year.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.905" end="00:22:23.805" style="s2">Then Papa had a kiosk tongue. I will</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.105" end="00:22:26.706" style="s2">order from a Lagos baker. A real cake</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.805" end="00:22:26.706" style="s2">for a real wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.406" end="00:22:33.106" style="s2">Two weeks of flour gone into the bin.</p>
<p begin="00:22:30.206" end="00:22:36.306" style="s2">Ebehi, next Friday you pay double.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.106" end="00:22:38.306" style="s2">100,000 Naira for wasted flour.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.306" end="00:22:39.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, you asked for it free. I made it</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.306" end="00:22:44.106" style="s2">free.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.806" end="00:22:44.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And free is exactly what it tastes like.</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.506" end="00:22:52.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dear, it is the groom&#39;s grandmother.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.706" end="00:22:55.806" style="s2">Is everything ready for the Ivory Hall</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.906" end="00:22:57.406" style="s2">the last Saturday of this month, 2:00?</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.806" end="00:22:59.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.406" end="00:23:02.006" style="s2">Ma, can my fiance not call me on video</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.706" end="00:23:03.706" style="s2">even one time?</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.006" end="00:23:06.106" style="s2">My friends keep asking what he looks</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.706" end="00:23:06.106" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.206" end="00:23:12.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My grandson does not do video calls, my</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.406" end="00:23:14.806" style="s2">dear. He wants to see your face first in</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.906" end="00:23:17.306" style="s2">the hall.</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.806" end="00:23:21.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is shy, ma. I like shy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.306" end="00:23:21.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Then you will like him very much.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.026" end="00:23:25.046" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.206" end="00:23:32.206" style="s2">A groom nobody has seen.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.206" end="00:23:32.206" style="s2">This is a love story for my page.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.606" end="00:23:44.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, sir, you did not call. Sit, sit.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.606" end="00:23:46.206" style="s2">What will you drink?</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.306" end="00:23:47.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not drink at my clients&#39; houses,</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.206" end="00:23:48.506" style="s2">madam.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.206" end="00:23:50.206" style="s2">I count.</p>
<p begin="00:23:48.506" end="00:23:52.806" style="s2">How much of my 40 million is still in</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.206" end="00:23:54.906" style="s2">your account?</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.806" end="00:23:58.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have spent it wisely, sir. The hall</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.906" end="00:23:59.906" style="s2">deposit, the cars, the guards, and a</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.006" end="00:24:02.406" style="s2">cake from Lagos.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.906" end="00:24:06.506" style="s2">Real fondant.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.406" end="00:24:06.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the answer is not much.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.006" end="00:24:17.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 million more, sir. Only to finish.</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.906" end="00:24:18.306" style="s2">The hall wants its balance, the caterers</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.006" end="00:24:20.906" style="s2">want theirs,</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.306" end="00:24:22.206" style="s2">and then everything is settled.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.906" end="00:24:24.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.206" end="00:24:27.906" style="s2">I have taken houses from men who had</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.006" end="00:24:27.906" style="s2">senators dancing at their weddings.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.606" end="00:24:33.307" style="s2">Before noon on the Monday after your</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.908" end="00:24:36.607" style="s2">engagement, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.307" end="00:24:36.607" style="s2">Not one minute after.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.007" end="00:24:42.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After Saturday, I am Mrs. Osayande. I</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.408" end="00:24:45.107" style="s2">will pay you from my pocket money.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.408" end="00:24:47.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not lend to pockets. I lend to</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.107" end="00:24:47.707" style="s2">roofs.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.107" end="00:24:51.107" style="s2">Which window is mine?</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.967" end="00:25:03.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.207" end="00:25:06.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, relax. He is a dog that barks at</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.707" end="00:25:08.307" style="s2">the gates, nothing more.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.307" end="00:25:10.307" style="s2">Listen to me well.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.307" end="00:25:13.007" style="s2">If that wedding moves by one day, we are</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.307" end="00:25:13.007" style="s2">finished.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.807" end="00:25:21.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never finished that story.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.107" end="00:25:24.207" style="s2">The stamp.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.408" end="00:25:24.207" style="s2">The night you cried.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.307" end="00:25:30.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was nine. Papa stamped the first loaf</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.607" end="00:25:33.507" style="s2">of every morning himself. Nobody else</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.908" end="00:25:33.507" style="s2">could touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.027" end="00:25:37.707" style="s2">[music] I wanted to be the one, so I</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.107" end="00:25:40.507" style="s2">took it off the oven ledge while his</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.707" end="00:25:43.307" style="s2">back was turned.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.507" end="00:25:46.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And it was hot.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.307" end="00:25:49.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was red. Papa held my thumb in the</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.007" end="00:25:49.908" style="s2">water drum until the sun came up.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.707" end="00:25:56.707" style="s2">In the morning, he put the stamp in my</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.307" end="00:25:59.507" style="s2">hand and said,</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.707" end="00:26:01.408" style="s2">Today you stamp every loaf. My thumb was</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.507" end="00:26:03.507" style="s2">the price of the job.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.408" end="00:26:03.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.807" end="00:26:08.408" style="s2">That is a hard way to get hired.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.707" end="00:26:12.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is the best way.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.408" end="00:26:12.408" style="s2">Nobody could ever say I did not earn it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.507" end="00:26:17.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now,</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.707" end="00:26:17.707" style="s2">what does the baker want?</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.307" end="00:26:27.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The front room of my father&#39;s house, the</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.707" end="00:26:29.909" style="s2">one by the road.</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.408" end="00:26:32.909" style="s2">Crescent Bakery again, with a door that</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.909" end="00:26:32.909" style="s2">faces the street.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.709" end="00:26:37.109" style="s2">People walk in from the road with their</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.209" end="00:26:39.709" style="s2">money in their hand, not round the back</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.109" end="00:26:39.709" style="s2">like thieves.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.309" end="00:26:45.509" style="s2">And you? Where are your people?</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.509" end="00:26:47.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My grandmother raised me. She wants me</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.509" end="00:26:49.909" style="s2">to marry well.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.009" end="00:26:52.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then she will hate me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.909" end="00:26:52.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She will love your bread.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.609" end="00:27:02.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now the bread knows your hand too.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.209" end="00:27:10.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One at a time, my brothers. Money in the</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.609" end="00:27:12.709" style="s2">other. The moon is not running away from</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.509" end="00:27:12.709" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.809" end="00:27:18.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See him. The other day he dey beg for</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.709" end="00:27:20.709" style="s2">one loaf. Now he dey shout like oga for</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.109" end="00:27:20.709" style="s2">motor park.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.309" end="00:27:28.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama no sir. If I shout well enough,</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.009" end="00:27:28.909" style="s2">maybe my boss will pay me 300 naira.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.909" end="00:27:36.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shout better than that and I will think</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.309" end="00:27:39.809" style="s2">about</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.809" end="00:27:39.809" style="s2">250.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.909" end="00:27:52.709" style="s2">That was your bread. That was your pay</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.009" end="00:27:54.609" style="s2">for the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.709" end="00:27:57.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was hungrier than me this morning. I</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.609" end="00:27:57.509" style="s2">can see it from here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.709" end="00:28:04.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.809" end="00:28:06.309" style="s2">My father used to say bread does not ask</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.709" end="00:28:09.509" style="s2">who you are.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.309" end="00:28:09.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father would have liked me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.809" end="00:28:16.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father liked everybody. That is how</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.109" end="00:28:16.609" style="s2">he died poor in a rich house.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.209" end="00:28:22.609" style="s2">Take this one. Do not give it away</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.709" end="00:28:22.609" style="s2">before you eat it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.009" end="00:28:29.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ebehi, that one is not a beggar. Beggars</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.309" end="00:28:29.009" style="s2">do not give.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.409" end="00:28:37.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bride who starves before her</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.210" end="00:28:38.610" style="s2">engagement faints on the day.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.310" end="00:28:40.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.610" end="00:28:42.510" style="s2">One day I want my own house to look like</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.610" end="00:28:44.310" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.510" end="00:28:46.310" style="s2">You drive for the family, so you drive</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.310" end="00:28:49.510" style="s2">for my husband.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.310" end="00:28:49.510" style="s2">Is your Oga handsome?</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.310" end="00:28:57.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sai is very Sai is in Rotterdam, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.610" end="00:28:59.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pious has never answered a question</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.210" end="00:29:03.310" style="s2">straight in his life. Put the dome down,</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.610" end="00:29:03.310" style="s2">my son, before it lands in the rice.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.510" end="00:29:09.810" style="s2">Tell me, my dear, do you have a sister?</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.110" end="00:29:14.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, ma. Only a girl from the back we</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.410" end="00:29:17.410" style="s2">keep out of charity.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.810" end="00:29:19.410" style="s2">She begs for us sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.410" end="00:29:20.510" style="s2">A poor relation of my late husband,</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.410" end="00:29:23.510" style="s2">mama.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.510" end="00:29:23.510" style="s2">We give her a roof.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.110" end="00:29:28.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charity.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.710" end="00:29:31.710" style="s2">That is a fine word.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.810" end="00:29:31.710" style="s2">I will keep it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.710" end="00:29:42.310" style="s2">Now here our custom before Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.710" end="00:29:44.110" style="s2">In this family, the groom does not</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.310" end="00:29:47.010" style="s2">arrive in a car.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.110" end="00:29:49.310" style="s2">He comes in by the gate on foot</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.010" end="00:29:51.310" style="s2">and waits there until the bride&#39;s people</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.310" end="00:29:53.710" style="s2">bring him in.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.310" end="00:29:55.510" style="s2">His father came that way.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.710" end="00:29:58.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On foot, ma? With all the guests</p>
<p begin="00:29:55.510" end="00:29:58.010" style="s2">watching?</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.110" end="00:30:08.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Especially with the guests watching.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.710" end="00:30:10.510" style="s2">A man learns everything about a house</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.310" end="00:30:12.210" style="s2">from how it treats whoever stands at its</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.510" end="00:30:14.310" style="s2">gate.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.210" end="00:30:16.310" style="s2">So look at the gate of the Ivory Hall on</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.310" end="00:30:19.510" style="s2">Saturday, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.310" end="00:30:21.610" style="s2">The last Saturday of this month, 2:00.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.510" end="00:30:23.510" style="s2">Look at it well.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.610" end="00:30:25.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will hire the best guards in Benin to</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.510" end="00:30:27.210" style="s2">welcome him. Nobody will stand at that</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.310" end="00:30:29.510" style="s2">gate except my husband.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.210" end="00:30:29.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.810" end="00:30:35.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, my caption, Saturday, he comes in</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.310" end="00:30:36.510" style="s2">by the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.010" end="00:30:40.712" style="s2">Post it in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.510" end="00:30:40.712" style="s2">Do not that old woman see you hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.412" end="00:30:49.812" style="s2">You are the company from our party.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.712" end="00:30:52.212" style="s2">The same men?</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.812" end="00:30:55.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The same men, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.212" end="00:30:57.412" style="s2">Twelve of us on Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.312" end="00:30:58.812" style="s2">Four at the gate, the rest inside the</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.412" end="00:31:01.112" style="s2">hall.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.812" end="00:31:02.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I want the same faces.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.112" end="00:31:04.912" style="s2">Clear my gate the way you cleared it</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.412" end="00:31:04.912" style="s2">last time.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.912" end="00:31:11.412" style="s2">If anything with sand on its feet sits</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.112" end="00:31:14.512" style="s2">at that gate on Saturday, it goes before</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.412" end="00:31:16.512" style="s2">my in-laws see it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.512" end="00:31:17.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, that beggar, the one from your</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.512" end="00:31:20.112" style="s2">party.</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.712" end="00:31:23.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about him?</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.112" end="00:31:24.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have not slept well since that night.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.012" end="00:31:27.212" style="s2">He did not fight.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.912" end="00:31:28.912" style="s2">He did not even raise his hand. He only</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.212" end="00:31:33.112" style="s2">looked at me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.912" end="00:31:33.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pay you to cane, not to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.012" end="00:31:38.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Decorators have ears, and ears have</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.312" end="00:31:40.512" style="s2">phones.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.812" end="00:31:42.412" style="s2">My daughter means you are paid well.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.512" end="00:31:44.212" style="s2">Sleep after Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.412" end="00:31:47.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time my husband&#39;s family will be</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.212" end="00:31:48.512" style="s2">inside. Nobody shames me in front of the</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.112" end="00:31:53.012" style="s2">Osayandes.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.512" end="00:31:53.012" style="s2">Not a beggar, not the wind, nobody.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.012" end="00:31:59.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hall is paid. That was the last of</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.212" end="00:32:00.812" style="s2">the man&#39;s money.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.112" end="00:32:02.612" style="s2">Then from Saturday we spend Osayande</p>
<p begin="00:32:00.812" end="00:32:05.712" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.612" end="00:32:09.112" style="s2">On Monday before noon</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.712" end="00:32:09.112" style="s2">we spend it on the lender.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.012" end="00:32:18.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is not here. My stepmother took my</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.112" end="00:32:21.812" style="s2">card for the hall list, she said. Three</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.112" end="00:32:23.212" style="s2">weeks now and she has not given it back.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.812" end="00:32:24.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe the hall is still writing its</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.212" end="00:32:27.512" style="s2">list.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.912" end="00:32:27.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.812" end="00:32:36.412" style="s2">Papa&#39;s scarf, it hung on that hook every</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.912" end="00:32:38.313" style="s2">night for six years.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.412" end="00:32:40.913" style="s2">I wear it to the junction and I always</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.313" end="00:32:40.913" style="s2">bring it home.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.413" end="00:32:45.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did you last see it there?</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.113" end="00:32:49.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The night they came in here about the</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.513" end="00:32:49.613" style="s2">rent. After that, nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.513" end="00:32:54.513" style="s2">I didn&#39;t need to meet with</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.413" end="00:33:01.313" style="s2">Ebehi,</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.513" end="00:33:03.213" style="s2">let me ask you something and promise you</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.313" end="00:33:04.913" style="s2">will not laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.213" end="00:33:08.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With flour on your nose like that, I</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.913" end="00:33:08.013" style="s2">cannot promise anything.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.413" end="00:33:12.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If a man had nothing,</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.313" end="00:33:15.613" style="s2">no house, no car, no family name behind</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.713" end="00:33:18.313" style="s2">him, nothing but these two hands,</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.613" end="00:33:18.313" style="s2">would you marry him?</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.613" end="00:33:25.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hands that</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.213" end="00:33:27.913" style="s2">gave their own loaf to an old man when</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.013" end="00:33:30.913" style="s2">they thought nobody was looking.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.913" end="00:33:33.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not an answer, Ebehi.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:35.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I would marry the hands.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.813" end="00:33:38.013" style="s2">Now go before the big house sees our</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.713" end="00:33:38.013" style="s2">lamp.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.113" end="00:33:46.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.913" end="00:34:05.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, you did not need to come all this</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.613" end="00:34:05.213" style="s2">way. We would have come to your office.</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.613" end="00:34:10.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like to see my roof, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.813" end="00:34:13.313" style="s2">A man who lands on a roof should know</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.213" end="00:34:13.313" style="s2">where the rain comes in.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.713" end="00:34:18.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No rain comes into this house. It is</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.513" end="00:34:20.913" style="s2">sound.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.613" end="00:34:22.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A fine roof. Your Ebehi pressed her</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.913" end="00:34:25.313" style="s2">thumb on it well.</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.313" end="00:34:25.313" style="s2">40 million naira.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.013" end="00:34:30.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, sir, not so loud. The neighbors.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.813" end="00:34:32.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your neighbors do not worry me. Monday</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.413" end="00:34:34.313" style="s2">worries me. Before noon on the Monday</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.513" end="00:34:36.713" style="s2">after your engagement,</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.313" end="00:34:39.913" style="s2">if my money is not on my desk, my boys</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.713" end="00:34:39.913" style="s2">are at this gate with a lorry.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.013" end="00:34:45.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will have it. My husband pays on</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.714" end="00:34:47.114" style="s2">Saturday night.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.414" end="00:34:50.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will see you on Monday, Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.114" end="00:34:50.114" style="s2">Osayande.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.814" end="00:35:02.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; was her.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.214" end="00:35:04.514" style="s2">Hush, somebody will hear. Who?</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.114" end="00:35:07.214" style="s2">The lemon tree? Every poor girl&#39;s thumb</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.514" end="00:35:07.214" style="s2">looks the same.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.814" end="00:35:17.614" style="s2">What was that?</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.914" end="00:35:20.514" style="s2">The wind.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.814" end="00:35:37.714" style="s2">Ebehi, you don&#39;t count that thing five</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.414" end="00:35:40.114" style="s2">times. The money no go grow because you</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.714" end="00:35:40.114" style="s2">look am.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.914" end="00:35:44.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Nosa, please go home. I will lock</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.114" end="00:35:47.214" style="s2">up tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.414" end="00:35:49.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I dey go. Osaro, if she cry, give her</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.214" end="00:35:50.214" style="s2">plantain.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.079" end="00:35:51.614" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.214" end="00:35:54.214" style="s2">Plantain dey cure everything except</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.614" end="00:35:54.214" style="s2">husband.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.914" end="00:36:00.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have not said 10 words since noon.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.114" end="00:36:00.114" style="s2">What happened in that house?</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.614" end="00:36:04.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A money lender walked across my father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.514" end="00:36:06.514" style="s2">courtyard today</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.114" end="00:36:09.814" style="s2">like a man buying it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.514" end="00:36:09.814" style="s2">They put the house on his paper.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.514" end="00:36:14.314" style="s2">40 million naira with a thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.214" end="00:36:15.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your thumb?</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.314" end="00:36:19.414" style="s2">You signed nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.714" end="00:36:19.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have never seen that paper in my life.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.214" end="00:36:24.914" style="s2">And when he left,</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.914" end="00:36:24.914" style="s2">Adesuwa laughed.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.614" end="00:36:29.914" style="s2">She said every poor girl&#39;s thumb looks</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.414" end="00:36:29.914" style="s2">the same.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.414" end="00:36:34.214" style="s2">My card is missing. My father&#39;s scarf is</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.814" end="00:36:35.814" style="s2">missing.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.214" end="00:36:37.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I know where they went. Ebehi,</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.814" end="00:36:39.114" style="s2">listen.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.114" end="00:36:43.714" style="s2">I know people in this city who can</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.114" end="00:36:43.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call who? With what? Your bread money?</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.916" end="00:36:53.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.716" end="00:36:57.416" style="s2">You carry trays for 200 Naira and I talk</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.916" end="00:36:57.416" style="s2">to you the way Adesuwa talks to me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.916" end="00:37:02.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You talk like a woman whose house is on</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.516" end="00:37:05.516" style="s2">fire.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.616" end="00:37:08.916" style="s2">I can carry that too.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.516" end="00:37:08.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will take this thing to a lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.016" end="00:37:12.316" style="s2">Maybe it is enough for him to read one</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.816" end="00:37:15.016" style="s2">paper.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.316" end="00:37:18.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me until Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.016" end="00:37:20.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saturday is my sister&#39;s engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.816" end="00:37:21.916" style="s2">They will dance in that hall</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.616" end="00:37:23.616" style="s2">and my father&#39;s house will pay for the</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.916" end="00:37:27.216" style="s2">music.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.616" end="00:37:27.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then give me until Saturday, Behi.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.416" end="00:37:32.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Behi.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.816" end="00:37:43.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It ends tonight, Yea.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.116" end="00:37:45.916" style="s2">Her father&#39;s house is on that man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.816" end="00:37:48.116" style="s2">paper in her name</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.916" end="00:37:50.316" style="s2">with somebody else&#39;s thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.116" end="00:37:52.616" style="s2">Pius pays him tomorrow and I bring her</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.316" end="00:37:55.516" style="s2">here in my own clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.616" end="00:37:57.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you rob her a second time.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.516" end="00:37:58.716" style="s2">If we pay that man, his paper becomes</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.616" end="00:38:00.616" style="s2">true.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.716" end="00:38:04.116" style="s2">All Benin will say the bread girl</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.616" end="00:38:04.116" style="s2">borrowed 40 million Naira</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.016" end="00:38:10.116" style="s2">and a rich old woman paid it. Her name</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.216" end="00:38:12.416" style="s2">stays on that paper for life.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.116" end="00:38:15.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I tear the paper up.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.416" end="00:38:18.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A torn paper still has a copy.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.516" end="00:38:20.416" style="s2">And if she learns tonight who you are,</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.216" end="00:38:22.016" style="s2">what does Adesuwa say?</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.416" end="00:38:23.316" style="s2">That her sister knew from the first</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.016" end="00:38:25.316" style="s2">plate</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.316" end="00:38:26.916" style="s2">that she fed a beggar at the back gate</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.316" end="00:38:29.316" style="s2">because she saw a billionaire under the</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.916" end="00:38:29.316" style="s2">dust.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.816" end="00:38:33.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody who has eaten her bread would</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.316" end="00:38:37.516" style="s2">believe that.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.516" end="00:38:37.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody who has not eaten it would.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.016" end="00:38:46.016" style="s2">That paper must break in front of the</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.516" end="00:38:49.117" style="s2">people who would believe it</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.016" end="00:38:52.481" style="s2">by the hand it lies about.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.117" end="00:38:53.017" style="s2">On Saturday, 2:00 in that hall.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.481" end="00:38:53.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.017" end="00:38:55.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.917" end="00:38:58.017" style="s2">that man keeps all his papers in the</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.717" end="00:38:59.917" style="s2">safe in his office.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.017" end="00:39:02.117" style="s2">Nothing leaves it unless he carries it</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.917" end="00:39:04.517" style="s2">himself.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.117" end="00:39:06.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he will carry it himself.</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.517" end="00:39:09.117" style="s2">Leave him to me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.617" end="00:39:12.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And until Saturday,</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.117" end="00:39:14.717" style="s2">Adesuwa had me canned at her own gate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.317" end="00:39:16.817" style="s2">What will she do to her sister?</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.717" end="00:39:19.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From tomorrow, I sit at that kiosk every</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.817" end="00:39:20.717" style="s2">morning so nobody touches her.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.417" end="00:39:24.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, you</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.717" end="00:39:26.417" style="s2">on a bench in the Okada smoke?</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.217" end="00:39:28.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pius, I sat on benches before your</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.417" end="00:39:30.317" style="s2">mother learned to walk.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.717" end="00:39:33.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring me groundnuts.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.317" end="00:39:35.317" style="s2">Then on Saturday, she hears it from me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.117" end="00:39:37.217" style="s2">From my own mouth, and not one day</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.317" end="00:39:39.417" style="s2">later.</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.217" end="00:39:41.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On Saturday, my son,</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.417" end="00:39:43.617" style="s2">and on Saturday, you come in by the</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.217" end="00:39:43.617" style="s2">gate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.847" end="00:39:48.917" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.517" end="00:39:51.217" style="s2">You dey shell groundnut like say you get</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.917" end="00:39:53.517" style="s2">army to feed. Slow down, leave some work</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.217" end="00:39:55.517" style="s2">for me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.517" end="00:39:59.117" style="s2">These hands have shelled groundnuts for</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.517" end="00:40:02.817" style="s2">70 years, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.117" end="00:40:02.817" style="s2">Nobody ever taught them to be slow.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.517" end="00:40:08.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, you have come every morning this</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.617" end="00:40:10.917" style="s2">week, and I still do not know your name.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.917" end="00:40:13.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Names are for people who want something</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.917" end="00:40:13.417" style="s2">from you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.017" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">I only want bread and a seat in the</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.917" end="00:40:20.117" style="s2">shade.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.317" end="00:40:22.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will call you the woman who pays</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.117" end="00:40:24.017" style="s2">too much.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.717" end="00:40:25.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.017" end="00:40:28.112" style="s2">And you charge too little. Between the</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.717" end="00:40:30.132" style="s2">two of us, we make one sensible woman.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.112" end="00:40:30.132" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.217" end="00:40:42.017" style="s2">You did not sleep last night, child.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.917" end="00:40:45.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something in my father&#39;s house is not</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.417" end="00:40:48.817" style="s2">right, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.717" end="00:40:52.118" style="s2">I cannot say it. I I say it yet.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.817" end="00:40:55.218" style="s2">Not until a lawyer has heard it first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.118" end="00:40:56.818" style="s2">Then say it when you are ready.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.218" end="00:41:01.318" style="s2">Until then,</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.818" end="00:41:01.318" style="s2">I will be on this bench every morning.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.318" end="00:41:11.418" style="s2">That is Osaro&#39;s grandmother</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.118" end="00:41:11.418" style="s2">in my sister&#39;s kiosk.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.318" end="00:41:18.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak quickly. I am counting money.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.618" end="00:41:19.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The girl is planning to run with her</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.118" end="00:41:21.218" style="s2">beggar before Monday. Take your roof</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.818" end="00:41:23.818" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.218" end="00:41:26.518" style="s2">Thursday at dawn, we will tell everyone</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.818" end="00:41:31.018" style="s2">the debt was hers.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.518" end="00:41:32.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run with my 40 million on her thumb?</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.018" end="00:41:34.518" style="s2">Thursday,</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.418" end="00:41:36.118" style="s2">5 o&#39;clock, have the gate open for my</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.518" end="00:41:38.418" style="s2">lorry.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.118" end="00:41:41.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thursday, your sister on the street two</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.418" end="00:41:41.518" style="s2">days before your party.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.918" end="00:41:46.718" style="s2">Did you see who was holding her hand?</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.418" end="00:41:49.318" style="s2">Some old woman shelling groundnuts. The</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.718" end="00:41:51.718" style="s2">Osayande grandmother in a cheap wrapper.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.318" end="00:41:53.318" style="s2">She is watching my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.718" end="00:41:54.918" style="s2">If that old woman hears my sister&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.318" end="00:41:56.918" style="s2">mouth before Saturday, I lose</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.918" end="00:42:00.118" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.918" end="00:42:00.118" style="s2">So what do we do about the beggar?</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.118" end="00:42:06.318" style="s2">Tomorrow evening, my phone goes into the</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.118" end="00:42:07.618" style="s2">beggar&#39;s sack and the police come for</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.318" end="00:42:10.518" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.618" end="00:42:10.518" style="s2">You will drop it in.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.818" end="00:42:15.418" style="s2">And if somebody sees me do it,</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.918" end="00:42:19.918" style="s2">then you film him and scream thief.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.018" end="00:42:26.818" style="s2">By Saturday, my sister will be a thief&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.218" end="00:42:27.918" style="s2">woman with a 40 million debt and no</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.818" end="00:42:31.618" style="s2">roof.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.918" end="00:42:31.618" style="s2">Nobody believes that kind of girl.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.818" end="00:42:36.518" style="s2">My page will eat it up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.918" end="00:42:38.818" style="s2">Mama, forgive our family. My sister</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.518" end="00:42:41.518" style="s2">borrowed 40 million naira and ran away</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.818" end="00:42:41.518" style="s2">with a beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.718" end="00:42:51.218" style="s2">Again,</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.218" end="00:42:51.218" style="s2">softer this time.</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.320" end="00:43:00.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 pieces of puff, my dear. Wrap them</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.220" end="00:43:03.720" style="s2">well. I am going somewhere nice tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.320" end="00:43:06.520" style="s2">10 pieces, still hot. 1,000 naira and</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.720" end="00:43:06.520" style="s2">the paper is free.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.120" end="00:43:18.320" style="s2">Arthur, the gate rat in the gray shirt.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.620" end="00:43:21.120" style="s2">He snatched my phone out of my hand at</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.320" end="00:43:21.120" style="s2">the filling station.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.220" end="00:43:23.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam,</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.120" end="00:43:26.220" style="s2">I have carried trays on this side of the</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.720" end="00:43:29.120" style="s2">road since 5:00.</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.220" end="00:43:29.120" style="s2">Ask anybody here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.420" end="00:43:35.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very dirty button on it, imán kin.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.920" end="00:43:42.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah-ah.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.920" end="00:43:46.020" style="s2">Wetin be this one now?</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.820" end="00:43:49.720" style="s2">That phone no dey that bag this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.020" end="00:43:49.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bread girls beggar is a thief.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.920" end="00:43:52.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hands.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.920" end="00:43:55.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both of them.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.020" end="00:43:55.020" style="s2">You are coming to the station.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.520" end="00:44:00.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has never taken a kobo he did not</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.320" end="00:44:00.820" style="s2">carry for.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.120" end="00:44:05.320" style="s2">He put his own payback in my tin.</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.620" end="00:44:07.420" style="s2">Search me too if you are looking for a</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.320" end="00:44:10.620" style="s2">thief.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.420" end="00:44:10.620" style="s2">Look at the crowd, sister.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.220" end="00:44:17.120" style="s2">You feed a man from the gate and he</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.120" end="00:44:17.120" style="s2">bites the first rich hand he sees.</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.720" end="00:44:21.220" style="s2">Choose your men better, sister.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.820" end="00:44:26.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.120" end="00:44:43.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every note in that tin came from bread.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.320" end="00:44:46.120" style="s2">Take it for his bill and let him walk</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.320" end="00:44:49.320" style="s2">home with me tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.120" end="00:44:49.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bill is free, my sister.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.320" end="00:44:54.520" style="s2">Put your money back inside your apron</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.020" end="00:44:56.521" style="s2">before somebody in this station sees it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.520" end="00:44:58.821" style="s2">The DPO signs at 8:00 in the morning. Go</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.521" end="00:44:58.821" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.921" end="00:45:04.021" style="s2">Go home, Ebehi.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.421" end="00:45:06.621" style="s2">Bake tonight like any other night.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.021" end="00:45:08.121" style="s2">6 o&#39;clock at the kiosk.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.621" end="00:45:09.321" style="s2">If they keep me, somebody will be there</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.121" end="00:45:11.621" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.321" end="00:45:15.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 6 o&#39;clock. If you are not there, I am</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.621" end="00:45:15.121" style="s2">coming back with the whole junction.</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.521" end="00:45:24.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer, call my grandmother.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.921" end="00:45:27.721" style="s2">I will give you her number.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.121" end="00:45:27.721" style="s2">I am Osaro Osayande.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.621" end="00:45:32.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course you are. Everybody in this</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.321" end="00:45:35.121" style="s2">cell is a billionaire&#39;s son.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.521" end="00:45:37.721" style="s2">That one by the wall owns the airport.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.121" end="00:45:37.721" style="s2">Sit down, chairman.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.721" end="00:45:44.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer, good evening, I beg.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.621" end="00:45:47.421" style="s2">I have come for that man. His arrest is</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.521" end="00:45:50.021" style="s2">already on the internet.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.421" end="00:45:52.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let the internet wait until 8:00.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.021" end="00:45:56.221" style="s2">The DPO signs at 8</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.021" end="00:45:56.221" style="s2">not you, not me, not his grandmother.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.521" end="00:46:03.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pious, forget me tonight. Be at her</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.021" end="00:46:03.021" style="s2">kiosk at 6. Do not let her be alone.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.121" end="00:46:21.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me. My bread is still in the</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.921" end="00:46:23.521" style="s2">oven.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.921" end="00:46:26.121" style="s2">Who sent you into my father&#39;s yard at</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.521" end="00:46:26.121" style="s2">this hour?</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.721" end="00:46:35.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear the borrower plans to run run</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.721" end="00:46:35.721" style="s2">away with her beggar before Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.621" end="00:46:40.121" style="s2">My money does not wait for a girl to</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.421" end="00:46:43.121" style="s2">run.</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.121" end="00:46:46.221" style="s2">Your name, your thumb,</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.121" end="00:46:46.221" style="s2">40 million naira.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.721" end="00:46:50.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is not my thumb. I have never sat</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.221" end="00:46:54.521" style="s2">in your office. I have never borrowed</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.721" end="00:46:54.521" style="s2">one naira from anybody in my life.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.621" end="00:47:00.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every borrower says that when the truck</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.422" end="00:47:00.723" style="s2">comes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.922" end="00:47:11.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bread girl borrowed 40 million</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.823" end="00:47:11.223" style="s2">naira.</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.723" end="00:47:20.422" style="s2">Ask her what she did with it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.823" end="00:47:23.523" style="s2">We are the ones going to a hotel until</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.422" end="00:47:23.523" style="s2">Saturday because of her.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.723" end="00:47:30.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, you took my card from the drawer for</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.323" end="00:47:31.523" style="s2">the hall list. You know where that money</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.122" end="00:47:34.523" style="s2">went.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.523" end="00:47:34.523" style="s2">It went into that hall.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.122" end="00:47:39.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear her.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.122" end="00:47:42.823" style="s2">A thief&#39;s woman shouting at her own</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.422" end="00:47:42.823" style="s2">mother before the whole street.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.348" end="00:47:46.368" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.922" end="00:47:52.863" style="s2">For six years you came in by the back</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.723" end="00:47:54.883" style="s2">gate, Ebehi. Today leave by the front.</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.863" end="00:47:54.883" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.323" end="00:48:11.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Papa, they have put your oven on the</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.223" end="00:48:11.823" style="s2">street.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.122" end="00:48:26.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said 6 o&#39;clock, Mama Nosa, and it is</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.323" end="00:48:26.122" style="s2">past 7.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.223" end="00:48:30.422" style="s2">They took the house and the oven. They</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.723" end="00:48:32.223" style="s2">took my name too.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.422" end="00:48:34.523" style="s2">I do not own anything now, not even my</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.223" end="00:48:34.523" style="s2">name.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.223" end="00:48:41.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your name is still on that sign and the</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.922" end="00:48:43.723" style="s2">sign is still hanging.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.223" end="00:48:43.723" style="s2">Wait small.</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.823" end="00:48:51.122" style="s2">Mama, na Mama Nosa, the plantain woman</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.422" end="00:48:52.723" style="s2">by the bread kiosk.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.122" end="00:48:55.723" style="s2">You said make I call if anything</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.723" end="00:48:55.723" style="s2">happened to this child.</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.323" end="00:48:59.523" style="s2">Mama, everything don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.124" end="00:49:12.024" style="s2">Ma, she is here. I have driven up and</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.524" end="00:49:14.124" style="s2">down this road since 6:00.</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.024" end="00:49:16.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept a seat for me on this bench,</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.124" end="00:49:16.724" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.924" end="00:49:21.624" style="s2">Today I came to take you off it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.324" end="00:49:23.124" style="s2">I have a room with a bed and a door that</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.624" end="00:49:26.424" style="s2">locks.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.124" end="00:49:26.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, ma, but no.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.224" end="00:49:30.924" style="s2">I said no to your shop and I am saying</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.324" end="00:49:33.224" style="s2">no to your room.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.924" end="00:49:35.624" style="s2">A room I did not pay for will never be</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.224" end="00:49:35.624" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.024" end="00:49:40.524" style="s2">Then come and bake for me. My kitchen</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.924" end="00:49:43.424" style="s2">has not smelled of bread since my</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.524" end="00:49:43.424" style="s2">husband died.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.124" end="00:49:53.224" style="s2">I will pay you for every loaf and you</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.624" end="00:49:53.224" style="s2">will pay me rent for the room.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.124" end="00:50:02.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the rent comes out of my pay, ma,</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.524" end="00:50:04.724" style="s2">not out of your kindness.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.524" end="00:50:07.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Out of your pay. I will write it in a</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.724" end="00:50:09.124" style="s2">book.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.124" end="00:50:13.124" style="s2">Then we take the oven too. It is</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.124" end="00:50:13.124" style="s2">cracked, but it still knows my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.024" end="00:50:26.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Nusa, where is she? They let me out</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.624" end="00:50:26.424" style="s2">at 8:00 and I ran the whole road.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.824" end="00:50:33.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are late, my brother.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.224" end="00:50:33.424" style="s2">The Korra mama took her.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.724" end="00:50:49.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit, child.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.424" end="00:50:51.824" style="s2">Before you bake one loaf in this house,</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.724" end="00:50:53.724" style="s2">hear this from my own mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.824" end="00:50:56.824" style="s2">I am the grandmother of the man your</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.724" end="00:50:56.824" style="s2">sister is marrying.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.924" end="00:51:01.124" style="s2">for 4 weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.224" end="00:51:05.925" style="s2">I have watched you too.</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.725" end="00:51:08.325" style="s2">The Osayande grandmother,</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.925" end="00:51:11.025" style="s2">you shelled groundnuts on my bench and</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.325" end="00:51:13.525" style="s2">you never said one word.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.025" end="00:51:16.025" style="s2">Would you have charged me 500 naira for</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.525" end="00:51:16.025" style="s2">a loaf?</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.525" end="00:51:21.225" style="s2">This morning your sister came to my</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.225" end="00:51:24.025" style="s2">house crying.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.225" end="00:51:25.225" style="s2">Her sister borrowed 40 million naira,</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.025" end="00:51:28.325" style="s2">she said,</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.225" end="00:51:30.725" style="s2">and ran away with a gate beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.325" end="00:51:33.325" style="s2">At my own table that same girl told me</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.725" end="00:51:36.725" style="s2">she had no sister.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.325" end="00:51:40.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you bring me here, ma?</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.725" end="00:51:40.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I watched who fed whom.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.325" end="00:51:45.625" style="s2">On your bench Mama Nosa told me your</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.525" end="00:51:48.125" style="s2">father&#39;s saying.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.625" end="00:51:50.325" style="s2">Your father was right, child. Bread does</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.125" end="00:51:53.125" style="s2">not ask who you are.</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.325" end="00:51:53.125" style="s2">Neither do I.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.925" end="00:52:03.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, look at the top of it, scratch.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.725" end="00:52:07.325" style="s2">And in the middle, nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.925" end="00:52:07.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What should be in the middle?</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.425" end="00:52:17.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My moon, this is not my thumb, ma. This</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.725" end="00:52:20.625" style="s2">thumb has never touched an oven.</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.325" end="00:52:20.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what has it touched?</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.125" end="00:52:24.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It has touched a nail file.</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.725" end="00:52:43.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you find this house?</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.525" end="00:52:46.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Nosa said the coral mama</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.025" end="00:52:46.725" style="s2">and the Okada men know her gate.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.625" end="00:52:51.825" style="s2">But first I went to Ihama Road.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.125" end="00:52:53.925" style="s2">It was in the mud by the stone gate</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.825" end="00:52:56.625" style="s2">post.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.925" end="00:52:59.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Papa Stamp, you slept in a cell and the</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.625" end="00:53:01.325" style="s2">first place you went was the mud.</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.225" end="00:53:02.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was late for you this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.325" end="00:53:05.125" style="s2">I was not going to be late for your</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.525" end="00:53:05.125" style="s2">father too.</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.225" end="00:53:08.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.527" end="00:53:11.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; how they did it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.627" end="00:53:14.427" style="s2">Mommy took my ID card from the drawer</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.127" end="00:53:16.327" style="s2">for the hall list, she said.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.427" end="00:53:17.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The same week Papa&#39;s moon scarf left the</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.327" end="00:53:19.427" style="s2">hook.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.327" end="00:53:22.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody walked into that man&#39;s office</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.427" end="00:53:24.527" style="s2">in my father&#39;s scarf with my card</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.527" end="00:53:26.427" style="s2">and pressed a thumb with a nail line on</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.527" end="00:53:28.027" style="s2">my name.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.427" end="00:53:29.727" style="s2">And in the courtyard Adesuwa laughed</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.027" end="00:53:31.427" style="s2">that every poor girl&#39;s thumb looks the</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.727" end="00:53:34.327" style="s2">same.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.427" end="00:53:34.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it is her thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.927" end="00:53:40.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who will believe the girl the whole</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.427" end="00:53:40.127" style="s2">street saw thrown out in the rain?</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.427" end="00:53:47.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ebehi,</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.527" end="00:53:49.627" style="s2">there is something about me you must</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.027" end="00:53:53.227" style="s2">know before Saturday. I am not</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.627" end="00:53:55.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me after Saturday, whatever it is.</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.227" end="00:53:57.927" style="s2">Even if you have a wife</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.327" end="00:53:58.927" style="s2">and five children in Warri,</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.927" end="00:54:01.827" style="s2">tell me</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.927" end="00:54:03.127" style="s2">after I take my father&#39;s house back.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.827" end="00:54:04.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No wife,</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.127" end="00:54:06.127" style="s2">no children,</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.327" end="00:54:08.227" style="s2">not in Warri, not anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.127" end="00:54:10.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have just told your money lender, come</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.227" end="00:54:11.627" style="s2">to the Ivory Hall on Saturday with your</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.027" end="00:54:13.827" style="s2">paper</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.627" end="00:54:17.027" style="s2">and you will be paid in full</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.827" end="00:54:17.027" style="s2">by the true borrower.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.127" end="00:54:23.727" style="s2">Their camera saw a girl in lavender, a</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.627" end="00:54:25.527" style="s2">phone and a sack.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.727" end="00:54:27.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the camera saw my sack before the</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.527" end="00:54:29.327" style="s2">police did.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.327" end="00:54:31.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I walk into my sister&#39;s engagement</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.327" end="00:54:34.327" style="s2">through the front door.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.227" end="00:54:34.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I will be at the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.727" end="00:54:53.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bride has arrived. Adesuwa, turn</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.827" end="00:54:55.027" style="s2">this way. The light is perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.427" end="00:54:56.827" style="s2">You again?</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.027" end="00:54:58.627" style="s2">The gate rat.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.827" end="00:55:00.427" style="s2">Guards,</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.627" end="00:55:03.427" style="s2">beat this thing away from my gate before</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.427" end="00:55:03.427" style="s2">my in-laws arrive.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.527" end="00:55:09.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.227" end="00:55:11.728" style="s2">The last time I beat this man,</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.528" end="00:55:13.828" style="s2">I went home</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.728" end="00:55:13.828" style="s2">and</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.928" end="00:55:20.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you mad? I paid you for today.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.628" end="00:55:22.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You paid me to guard your gate, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.528" end="00:55:23.828" style="s2">Nobody is attacking it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.528" end="00:55:26.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adesua,</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.828" end="00:55:29.228" style="s2">leave it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.328" end="00:55:29.228" style="s2">The in-laws are here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.928" end="00:55:39.028" style="s2">Mama, welcome, welcome. Everything is</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.028" end="00:55:41.728" style="s2">ready for my groom. I hired the best</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.028" end="00:55:45.128" style="s2">guards in Benin for the gates.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.728" end="00:55:45.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see them, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:56:06.128" end="00:56:10.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy,</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.728" end="00:56:10.728" style="s2">why is she with them?</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.218" end="00:56:19.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.228" end="00:56:24.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bride is seated, the families are</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.728" end="00:56:27.228" style="s2">gathering, and the groom of the</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.428" end="00:56:29.663" style="s2">Osaigbovo house is on his way.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.228" end="00:56:31.683" style="s2">MAKE SOME NOISE!</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.663" end="00:56:31.683" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.249" end="00:56:36.269" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.528" end="00:56:40.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHO LET THE BACK GATE GIRL IN THROUGH</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.128" end="00:56:44.428" style="s2">THE FRONT?</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.828" end="00:56:44.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did. She came with me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.349" end="00:56:49.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.028" end="00:56:56.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that man doing at your table,</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.928" end="00:56:56.328" style="s2">mama?</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.829" end="00:57:00.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.728" end="00:57:02.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon. Many of you know me as</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.928" end="00:57:05.128" style="s2">the girl who carries the bread in from</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.628" end="00:57:05.128" style="s2">the back.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.528" end="00:57:09.028" style="s2">You, sir,</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.128" end="00:57:10.428" style="s2">you came here today for 40 million</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.028" end="00:57:11.629" style="s2">naira.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.428" end="00:57:13.929" style="s2">Please stand up and show them your</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.629" end="00:57:13.929" style="s2">paper.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.429" end="00:57:20.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ebehi Godaro, her name, her thumb, her</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.629" end="00:57:20.729" style="s2">father&#39;s house on a hammer road.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.099" end="00:57:22.629" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.729" end="00:57:24.329" style="s2">I was promised payment in this hall</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.629" end="00:57:26.729" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.329" end="00:57:29.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You see? She has carried her debt into</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.729" end="00:57:32.229" style="s2">my engagement. Somebody take her out.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.329" end="00:57:35.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my name is on that paper.</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.229" end="00:57:35.529" style="s2">Now let us look at the thumb.</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.629" end="00:57:38.429" style="s2">Please bring me the ink pad from the</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.229" end="00:57:42.529" style="s2">guest book</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.429" end="00:57:44.729" style="s2">and put your camera on the big screen.</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.529" end="00:57:47.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ink pad and the big screen coming</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.729" end="00:57:47.629" style="s2">right now, madam.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.529" end="00:58:03.229" style="s2">My people, the big screen is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.429" end="00:58:03.229" style="s2">Madam, the floor is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.929" end="00:58:11.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is a moon inside her thumb. Look</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.329" end="00:58:14.229" style="s2">at it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.729" end="00:58:16.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I was nine, I took my father&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.229" end="00:58:18.929" style="s2">brass bread stamp off the oven ledge</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.429" end="00:58:20.829" style="s2">while his back was turned, still hot</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.929" end="00:58:22.829" style="s2">from the oven.</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.829" end="00:58:24.929" style="s2">I cried the whole night</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.829" end="00:58:27.829" style="s2">and he sat with me on the bakery floor</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.929" end="00:58:27.829" style="s2">until morning.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.229" end="00:58:37.329" style="s2">He told me now the bread will always</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.429" end="00:58:39.829" style="s2">know your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.329" end="00:58:42.929" style="s2">For six years, every loaf I sold at the</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.829" end="00:58:46.629" style="s2">junction has carried that moon.</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.929" end="00:58:46.629" style="s2">Some of you ate one this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.490" end="00:58:52.510" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.929" end="00:58:57.529" style="s2">Now look at that thumb, no moon, and</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.929" end="00:58:59.229" style="s2">that line across the top.</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.529" end="00:59:01.529" style="s2">A baker cannot keep long nails, the</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.229" end="00:59:03.429" style="s2">dough tears them off.</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.529" end="00:59:05.129" style="s2">That line is a nail. The woman who</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.429" end="00:59:08.029" style="s2">pressed that paper has never touched an</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.129" end="00:59:08.029" style="s2">oven in her life.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.429" end="00:59:17.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The The in my office her sunglasses on</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.931" end="00:59:17.731" style="s2">the whole time.</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.631" end="00:59:25.431" style="s2">She scratched my inkpad with her nail</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.131" end="00:59:25.431" style="s2">and I had to buy a new one.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.131" end="00:59:31.131" style="s2">And she wore a yellow scarf</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.531" end="00:59:33.031" style="s2">with little moons on it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.131" end="00:59:36.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father&#39;s scarf, it hung on the hook</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.031" end="00:59:36.831" style="s2">in his bakery until somebody lifted it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.631" end="00:59:41.331" style="s2">Adesuwa, every poor girl&#39;s thumb looks</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.931" end="00:59:43.131" style="s2">the same.</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.331" end="00:59:45.931" style="s2">Mine has a moon on it.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.131" end="00:59:45.931" style="s2">Show them yours.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.531" end="00:59:52.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hands, my dear. The guests are</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.331" end="00:59:54.831" style="s2">waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.631" end="00:59:56.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I pressed it. Somebody had to pay</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.831" end="00:59:58.831" style="s2">for this hall.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.631" end="01:00:00.731" style="s2">You were never going to use that house.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.831" end="01:00:02.331" style="s2">You sleep in a back room with flower in</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.731" end="01:00:05.531" style="s2">your hair.</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.331" end="01:00:05.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adesuwa, shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.931" end="01:00:11.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the 40 million Naira is yours to</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.531" end="01:00:11.731" style="s2">pay, madam.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.831" end="01:00:18.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It does not matter.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.331" end="01:00:21.931" style="s2">Today I marry Osaro Osayande.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.231" end="01:00:21.931" style="s2">My husband will pay you twice.</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.831" end="01:00:38.531" style="s2">Guards, who let this beggar into my</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.831" end="01:00:38.531" style="s2">engagement?</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.047" end="01:00:51.067" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.531" end="01:01:01.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.831" end="01:01:10.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hired the best guards in Benin to</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.631" end="01:01:12.731" style="s2">welcome him, my dear.</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.531" end="01:01:15.031" style="s2">The groom of the Osayande house comes in</p>
<p begin="01:01:12.731" end="01:01:16.632" style="s2">by the gate.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.031" end="01:01:19.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is the groom? The</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.632" end="01:01:22.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; in those clothes is the groom?</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.132" end="01:01:25.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Osayande, no, mama, it cannot be.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.532" end="01:01:25.632" style="s2">He is the gate beggar.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.632" end="01:01:33.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is the same man.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.832" end="01:01:36.207" style="s2">God forgive me, it is the same man.</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.832" end="01:01:36.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Osaro?</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.207" end="01:01:40.532" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.732" end="01:01:40.532" style="s2">Half of Benin is called Osaro.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.832" end="01:01:52.732" style="s2">Beat this thing away from my gate before</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.532" end="01:01:52.732" style="s2">my in-laws arrive.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.232" end="01:01:58.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your best friend posted it, madam. We</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.232" end="01:02:00.832" style="s2">only borrowed it for the big screen.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.632" end="01:02:03.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the wind, my dear. Look at your</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.832" end="01:02:03.232" style="s2">wind.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.332" end="01:02:12.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Osaro, my love, the video is a joke. My</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.532" end="01:02:13.932" style="s2">friend edits everything for her page.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.332" end="01:02:15.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At your gate, you never once looked at</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.932" end="01:02:17.232" style="s2">my face.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.332" end="01:02:19.732" style="s2">Look at it now. It is on the screen</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.232" end="01:02:19.732" style="s2">behind you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.432" end="01:02:25.132" style="s2">You made a hungry man pick your bread</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.332" end="01:02:25.132" style="s2">out of a gutter.</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.332" end="01:02:29.032" style="s2">You sent your sister through the back</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.032" end="01:02:32.432" style="s2">gate</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.032" end="01:02:35.813" style="s2">of her own father&#39;s house.</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.432" end="01:02:35.932" style="s2">You pressed your thumb on her name.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.813" end="01:02:39.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.932" end="01:02:42.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I had known it was you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.132" end="01:02:42.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is why I came as nobody.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.332" end="01:02:49.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That ring has stayed in this family for</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.132" end="01:02:50.832" style="s2">three generations.</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.032" end="01:02:54.532" style="s2">It will not leave it through a woman who</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.832" end="01:02:54.532" style="s2">canes our people at her gate.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.332" end="01:03:02.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adesuwa, I only posted what you asked me</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.032" end="01:03:02.732" style="s2">to post.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.032" end="01:03:11.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four weeks ago, I sat at a gate on a</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.832" end="01:03:13.732" style="s2">Hama Road with sand on my feet and my</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.932" end="01:03:16.032" style="s2">hand open.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.732" end="01:03:17.733" style="s2">I wanted to know one thing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.032" end="01:03:20.733" style="s2">What would the woman I was to marry give</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.733" end="01:03:20.733" style="s2">a man who had nothing?</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.533" end="01:03:25.933" style="s2">You all saw what she gave.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.733" end="01:03:28.133" style="s2">A cane</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.933" end="01:03:31.333" style="s2">in front of 40 guests</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.133" end="01:03:33.133" style="s2">and a camera so nobody would forget it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.333" end="01:03:35.033" style="s2">That same night a girl came round the</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.133" end="01:03:37.533" style="s2">back of that wall with her own dinner on</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.033" end="01:03:37.533" style="s2">a plate.</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.533" end="01:03:50.533" style="s2">The next morning she gave me trays to</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.433" end="01:03:53.033" style="s2">carry,</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.533" end="01:03:56.633" style="s2">bread for my work,</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.033" end="01:03:58.733" style="s2">and 200 naira she could not spare.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.633" end="01:04:00.533" style="s2">When they took her father&#39;s house</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.733" end="01:04:03.433" style="s2">she still pushed her last tin across a</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.533" end="01:04:03.433" style="s2">police for my bail.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.133" end="01:04:08.433" style="s2">One woman ordered me beaten.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.533" end="01:04:11.933" style="s2">One gave me her own dinner and a job and</p>
<p begin="01:04:08.433" end="01:04:11.933" style="s2">never once asked who I was.</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.133" end="01:04:17.133" style="s2">So now I am asking her in front of</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.133" end="01:04:17.133" style="s2">everybody who laughed.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.833" end="01:04:23.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You slept in a cell</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.833" end="01:04:26.833" style="s2">and I slept in the rain and all that</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.633" end="01:04:26.833" style="s2">time you knew who you were.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.733" end="01:04:31.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew who I was.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.633" end="01:04:35.733" style="s2">I did not know who I would find.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.933" end="01:04:35.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked me to give you until Saturday.</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.533" end="01:04:41.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is Saturday.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.333" end="01:04:44.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then hear my condition in front of all</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.533" end="01:04:44.933" style="s2">these people. No more tests, not one,</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.533" end="01:04:47.533" style="s2">ever.</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.933" end="01:04:47.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not one.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.333" end="01:04:57.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I would marry the hands.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.933" end="01:04:57.133" style="s2">I meant the hands.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.294" end="01:04:59.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.933" end="01:05:06.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The side door, now before they close it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.133" end="01:05:23.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Officer, the filling station camera,</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.935" end="01:05:25.735" style="s2">Wednesday evening, the junction. Watch</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.235" end="01:05:25.735" style="s2">her hand.</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.035" end="01:05:30.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The one billionaire son in my cell, and</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.435" end="01:05:32.335" style="s2">I did not believe him.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.935" end="01:05:34.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me the other one owns the</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.335" end="01:05:36.535" style="s2">airport.</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.135" end="01:05:38.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, that one still owns nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.535" end="01:05:41.635" style="s2">Madam Adesua, you are under arrest for</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.835" end="01:05:44.835" style="s2">forgery and a false complaint.</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.635" end="01:05:46.535" style="s2">Madam Gladys, for forgery.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.835" end="01:05:48.335" style="s2">And you, my sister with the camera, for</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.535" end="01:05:50.635" style="s2">planting a phone in an innocent man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.335" end="01:05:50.635" style="s2">sack.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.335" end="01:05:56.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was her phone.</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.935" end="01:05:56.435" style="s2">I only did what she told me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.035" end="01:06:05.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this the yellow scarf?</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.935" end="01:06:09.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is the scarf.</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.535" end="01:06:09.535" style="s2">That is the girl who sat in my office.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.635" end="01:06:16.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And your card, my sister.</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.435" end="01:06:19.835" style="s2">It was sleeping in her purse.</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.635" end="01:06:19.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She took it for the haul list.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.135" end="01:06:23.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your car keys, madam, and that gold on</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.435" end="01:06:24.135" style="s2">your neck,</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.735" end="01:06:27.635" style="s2">on account.</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.135" end="01:06:27.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This gold is not even mine.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.835" end="01:06:32.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the jeweler can come and collect it</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.535" end="01:06:32.935" style="s2">from me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.235" end="01:06:42.835" style="s2">The keys of the house on Ikorodu Road.</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.135" end="01:06:45.235" style="s2">My paper is dead.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.835" end="01:06:48.135" style="s2">I lend money, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.235" end="01:06:51.635" style="s2">I do not lend lies.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.135" end="01:06:53.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ebehi, Ebehi, I am your sister.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.635" end="01:06:56.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At his grandmother&#39;s table, you said you</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.335" end="01:06:59.135" style="s2">had no sister.</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.035" end="01:07:01.235" style="s2">For 13 years, I kept you in that house.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.135" end="01:07:03.535" style="s2">For 13 years, you kept me at the back of</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.235" end="01:07:03.535" style="s2">it, ma.</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.335" end="01:07:09.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This way, madam. The front is for</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.835" end="01:07:09.335" style="s2">guests.</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.191" end="01:07:16.211" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.535" end="01:07:27.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turn them now, Ebehi. My don&#39;t climb</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.936" end="01:07:27.536" style="s2">reach my mouth.</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.136" end="01:07:39.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Papa, the front door is open.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.436" end="01:07:48.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ebehi, keep your money. Na family we be.</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.936" end="01:07:52.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, you watched my kiosk for free for</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.336" end="01:07:56.236" style="s2">six years. Family gets paid.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.036" end="01:07:56.236" style="s2">Take it or I will burn your plantain.</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.736" end="01:08:01.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, I held the cane for 11 years.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.006" end="01:08:04.026" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.436" end="01:08:12.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And to think I gave a billionaire my</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.836" end="01:08:12.236" style="s2">son&#39;s old gray shirt washed and ironed.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.536" end="01:08:19.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam Ebehi,</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.136" end="01:08:22.536" style="s2">Iye&#39;s order for the wedding,</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.336" end="01:08:24.536" style="s2">400 moon loaves and a cake.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.536" end="01:08:26.836" style="s2">Five tiers.</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.536" end="01:08:29.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five tiers? The last five tiers I baked</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.836" end="01:08:32.836" style="s2">nobody paid for.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.636" end="01:08:32.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She knew you would say that.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.936" end="01:08:36.336" style="s2">She says you must send her the full</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.336" end="01:08:38.236" style="s2">bill.</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.336" end="01:08:41.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell Iye this time I will take her</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.236" end="01:08:44.736" style="s2">money. I baked for it.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.336" end="01:08:44.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She also said to charge her more.</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.936" end="01:08:51.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bread girl, so the whole house is We</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.436" end="01:08:53.636" style="s2">heard you borrowed 40 million.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.236" end="01:08:56.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard wrong, ma. My father left me</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.636" end="01:08:58.036" style="s2">this house and today I opened his front</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.436" end="01:09:00.536" style="s2">door.</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.036" end="01:09:03.336" style="s2">The bread is still 500 naira.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.536" end="01:09:05.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told all of you from the first day</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.336" end="01:09:09.236" style="s2">that man was no beggar.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.736" end="01:09:09.236" style="s2">Beggars do not give.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.936" end="01:09:17.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His father rang from London this</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.536" end="01:09:19.836" style="s2">morning. His stitches are out and he</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.636" end="01:09:21.736" style="s2">asked me only one question.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.836" end="01:09:22.936" style="s2">Does the girl&#39;s bread have the moon on</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.736" end="01:09:25.636" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.936" end="01:09:26.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you tell him, ma?</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.636" end="01:09:29.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told him</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.338" end="01:09:30.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to come home and tasted himself.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.777" end="01:09:32.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.838" end="01:09:36.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, she made me carry trays in front</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.838" end="01:09:36.737" style="s2">of the whole junction for four weeks.</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.983" end="01:09:39.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.038" end="01:09:45.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father carried my firewood for 10</p>
<p begin="01:09:42.338" end="01:09:47.237" style="s2">years before he carried any company.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.538" end="01:09:48.838" style="s2">Let him come and see his son with flour</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.237" end="01:09:51.338" style="s2">on him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.838" end="01:09:53.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, if chairman comes to that kiosk, I</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.338" end="01:09:56.838" style="s2">am not standing near him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.137" end="01:09:56.838" style="s2">I will salute and finish my life.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.538" end="01:10:07.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For six years you used the back gate of</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.538" end="01:10:07.838" style="s2">your father&#39;s house house.</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.438" end="01:10:16.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When my father died, I thought I had</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.438" end="01:10:18.137" style="s2">become a girl people kept out of pity.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.338" end="01:10:21.137" style="s2">A room at the back,</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.137" end="01:10:25.137" style="s2">a plate from the staff pot.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.137" end="01:10:25.137" style="s2">But I was never anybody&#39;s charity.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.137" end="01:10:31.038" style="s2">I was somebody&#39;s daughter and I paid my</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.338" end="01:10:32.838" style="s2">own way with my own two hands. And now I</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.038" end="01:10:35.438" style="s2">am somebody&#39;s family.</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.838" end="01:10:35.438" style="s2">I am home.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.938" end="01:10:39.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more tests. I gave my word in front</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.938" end="01:10:42.038" style="s2">of 200 people.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.938" end="01:10:43.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.038" end="01:10:45.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One?</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.538" end="01:10:47.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You eat my bread every morning for the</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.538" end="01:10:50.999" style="s2">rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.738" end="01:10:53.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, is that a test or a sentence?</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.999" end="01:10:53.019" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.838" end="01:11:08.738" style="s2">Madam,</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.938" end="01:11:10.538" style="s2">I only wanted to hold his hand while he</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.738" end="01:11:14.338" style="s2">eats.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.538" end="01:11:14.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then hold it. Let him sit where he is.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.438" end="01:11:24.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat, sir. The guests can wait. There are</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.438" end="01:11:24.338" style="s2">no chairs inside.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.438" end="01:11:27.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You,</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.538" end="01:11:28.839" style="s2">the young man from the junction who gave</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.438" end="01:11:30.539" style="s2">me his bread.</p>
<p begin="01:11:28.839" end="01:11:33.739" style="s2">You look different.</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.539" end="01:11:36.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wash now. My bride makes me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.739" end="01:11:39.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last time he sat on that post, sir,</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.439" end="01:11:39.939" style="s2">the bride had him caned.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.239" end="01:11:44.839" style="s2">This time the bride is serving.</p>
<p begin="01:11:43.339" end="01:11:46.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this time I am staying for the</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.839" end="01:11:47.639" style="s2">bread.</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.139" end="01:11:49.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ebehi,</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.639" end="01:11:52.439" style="s2">the MC is calling the bride and groom.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.839" end="01:11:54.739" style="s2">The whole compound is waiting inside oh.</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.439" end="01:11:56.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them wait, Mama Nosa.</p>
<p begin="01:11:54.739" end="01:11:58.639" style="s2">They came in by the front door and they</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.839" end="01:12:01.839" style="s2">have chairs.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.639" end="01:12:05.014" style="s2">Today this family waits for its bread.</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.839" end="01:12:05.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine bread. Moon dey for the top.</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.014" end="01:12:08.539" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.639" end="01:12:11.339" style="s2">Na the same moon from the junction.</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.539" end="01:12:11.339" style="s2">Who are you people?</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.565" end="01:12:17.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.439" end="01:12:17.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bread does not ask who you are.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
